This directory vendors code from:

Jungjee/RawNet, python/RawNet3
https://github.com/Jungjee/RawNet

By Jee-weon Jung.

MIT License (see LICENSE).

Vendored files (models/RawNet3.py, models/RawNetBasicBlock.py, models/__init__.py)
are checked out unmodified.

Upstream RawNet3 is a VoxCeleb speaker-verification model: RawNet3.forward()
returns an nOut-dim speaker embedding, not a real/fake score. This project's
train_heimdall.py wraps the vendored backbone with a separate classification
head (see RawNet3Classifier) to adapt it for the real/fake binary task —
the wrapper lives in train_heimdall.py, not in the vendored model files.

New dependency introduced by this vendoring: asteroid_filterbanks (used by
models/RawNet3.py for the learnable sinc front-end, ParamSincFB/Encoder).
